{
  "id": 8867179299015,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 05",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-05",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with a personalized touch with this custom baseball comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for baseball enthusiasts, this comfortable and durable bedding set is perfect for adding a sporty flair to any room, celebrating your passion for the game.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Celebrate your love for baseball with this unique and personalized bedding set, perfect for players and fans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit your bed perfectly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel. Features whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques in the finishing process to ensure dye retention and prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization:</strong> Features text input options for personalization, allowing you to add a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, providing a complete and stylish bedding solution.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Multiple Size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
